WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.954
Use equally spaced axes and plot coordinate pairs (time, measurement), then connect

00:00:04.954 --> 00:00:05.747
in order.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:13.368
A line graph begins at 12 on day 1 and increases by 6 daily. Find day 5. The answer

00:00:13.368 --> 00:00:19.054
is 36. Value on day 5 is 12 plus (5 minus 1) times 6 equals 36.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:25.528
The reading chart during a sports day shows 12 books on day 1 and rises by 5 each

00:00:25.528 --> 00:00:29.616
day. What y-value is plotted for day 2? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:36.385
The reading chart during a sports day shows 12 books on day 1 and rises by 5 each

00:00:36.385 --> 00:00:42.649
day. What y-value is plotted for day 2? The answer is 17. Value on day 2 is 12 plus

00:00:42.649 --> 00:00:44.957
(2 minus 1) times 5 equals 17.
